sec.p:
The photothermal performance of Cu2-xSe/PDA/IR820 was evaluated by exposing an aqueous suspension of the nanocomposites to an 808 nm laser at a power density of 1 W/cm2. Temperature changes were monitored in real time using an infrared thermal camera. The photothermal conversion efficiency (η) was calculated according to the following equation:
(1)\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
